an begin="26.097" end="26.513">up</span> <span begin="26.649" end="27.132">from</span> <span begin="27.132" end="27.316">a</span> <span begin="27.316" end="28.575">dream</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我 我刚从梦中醒来</span></p><p begin="29.693" end="33.377" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="29.693" end="29.970">Where</span> <span begin="29.970" end="30.234">you</span> <span begin="30.234" end="30.434">and</span> <span begin="30.434" end="31.117">I</span> <span begin="31.117" end="31.549">had</span> <span begin="31.549" end="31.717">to</span> <span begin="31.717" end="32.301">say</span> <span begin="32.301" end="33.377">bye</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦里你我不得不说再见</span></p><p begin="34.765" end="38.945" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="34.765" end="35.075">And</span> <span begin="35.075" end="35.403">I</span> <span begin="35.403" end="35.968">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="35.968" end="36.603">know</span> <span begin="36.603" end="36.984">what</span> <span begin="36.984" end="37.269">it</span> <span begin="37.269" end="37.669">all</span> <span begin="37.669" end="38.945">means</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道这一切意味着什么</span></p><p begin="40.294" end="44.644" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="40.294" end="40.470">But</span> <span begin="40.470" end="40.819">since</span> <span begin="40.819" end="41.187">I</span> <span begin="41.187" end="42.203">survived,</span> <span begin="42.203" end="42.854">I</span> <span begin="42.854" end="44.644">realized</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但醒来之后 我意识到</span></p></div><div begin="45.626" end="1:02.712" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="45.626" end="50.644" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="45.626" end="46.215">Wherever</span> <span begin="46.215" end="46.498">you</span> <span begin="46.498" end="47.085">go,</span> <span begin="47.085" end="47.517">that&apos;s</span> <span begin="47.517" end="